IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g4-council-work`
IMPORT `g5-testing-bodies`
IMPORT `g7-commencement`

-- ind-b-tests-ambiguous.l4: assertions that FAIL (or REFUSE) where the SOURCE is ambiguous: my reading, which
-- the encoder did not take.  Each scenario id is from work/ind-b/expectations.md; the encoder registered every one
-- of these as a fork, and where it offers my reading as a callable alternative that alternative passes in the
-- main test files.  Expected: 16 assertions failed, 2 refused.

§ `ind-b: readings of ambiguous text that the encoding did not take`

GIVEN s46 IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `Facts that fix the commencement of the Law under section 63`
`ind-b actual facts with s.46 regulations` s46 MEANS
    `Facts that fix the commencement of the Law under section 63` WITH
        `the day the Law was published in Reshumot` IS YMD 2025 1 14
        `the s.59 regulations came into force on` IS YMD 2025 7 16
        `the day regulations under section 46 came into force, if any` IS s46

GIVEN regs IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Facts that fix the commencement of the Law under section 63`
`ind-b facts with regulations in force on` regs MEANS
    `Facts that fix the commencement of the Law under section 63` WITH
        `the day the Law was published in Reshumot` IS YMD 2025 1 14
        `the s.59 regulations came into force on` IS regs
        `the day regulations under section 46 came into force, if any` IS NOTHING

GIVEN d IS A STRING
GIVETH A `Cooling system`
`ind-b a system using the lawful refrigerant` d MEANS
    `Cooling system` WITH
        `cooling capacity in kilowatts` IS 10
        `refrigerants` IS LIST (Refrigerant WITH `designation` IS d, `use of the refrigerant is permitted by law` IS TRUE)

§§ `A1. s.63(a)(1): three months from the LATER of the two days (Reading A), against the encoder's Reading B (fork F-C-3)`

-- src:461 | {{ח:תתת|(1)}} לעניין ביצוע עבודה במערכת קירור או מיזוג אוויר הפועלת באמצעות קרר דליק המנוי {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 4|בתוספת הרביעית}}, ובלבד שהשימוש בו הותר על פי כל דין – שלושה חודשים מיום פרסומו או מועד כניסתן לתוקף של תקנות לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 59|סעיף 59}}, לפי המאוחר (להלן – יום התחילה); השר, לאחר התייעצות עם השר להגנת הסביבה, רשאי לשנות, בצו, את {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 4|התוספת הרביעית}};
-- src:464 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} תחילתו של {{ח:פנימי|פרק ו|פרק ו׳}} 18 חודשים מיום התחילה או במועד כניסתן לתוקף של תקנות לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 46|סעיף 46}}, לפי המאוחר.
-- In (a)(1) one preposition (mi-, "from") governs both days, so the three months run from the later of them; (b)
-- shows how the drafter writes the other shape, with the preposition be- ("on") before its second limb.
-- Reading A: the commencement day 16.10.2025, paragraph (2) 16.4.2027.
-- K63-1
#ASSERT `the commencement day under section 63(a)(1)` (`ind-b actual facts with s.46 regulations` NOTHING) EQUALS YMD 2025 10 16
-- K63-6
#ASSERT `the day the Law commences for a system with any other refrigerant under section 63(a)(2)` (`ind-b actual facts with s.46 regulations` NOTHING) EQUALS YMD 2027 4 16
-- K63-3, K63-4: a lawful 290 system on 15.10.2025 and on 16.7.2025: not yet.
#ASSERT NOT `the Law has commenced for work on the system` (`ind-b a system using the lawful refrigerant` "290") `on the day` (YMD 2025 10 15) `given the facts` (`ind-b actual facts with s.46 regulations` NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT `the Law has commenced for work on the system` (`ind-b a system using the lawful refrigerant` "290") `on the day` (YMD 2025 7 16) `given the facts` (`ind-b actual facts with s.46 regulations` NOTHING)
-- K63-7: 410A on 15.4.2027: not yet; on 16.1.2027: not yet.
#ASSERT NOT `the Law has commenced for work on the system` (`ind-b a system using the lawful refrigerant` "410A") `on the day` (YMD 2027 4 15) `given the facts` (`ind-b actual facts with s.46 regulations` NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT `the Law has commenced for work on the system` (`ind-b a system using the lawful refrigerant` "410A") `on the day` (YMD 2027 1 16) `given the facts` (`ind-b actual facts with s.46 regulations` NOTHING)
-- K63-12: s.46 regulations in force 1.1.2026: Chapter 6 commences 16.4.2027.
#ASSERT `the day Chapter 6 commences under section 63(b)` (`ind-b actual facts with s.46 regulations` (JUST (YMD 2026 1 1))) EQUALS YMD 2027 4 16
#ASSERT NOT `Chapter 6 was in force on the day of the act` (YMD 2027 4 15) `given the facts` (`ind-b actual facts with s.46 regulations` (JUST (YMD 2026 1 1)))
#ASSERT NOT `Chapter 6 was in force on the day of the act` (YMD 2027 1 16) `given the facts` (`ind-b actual facts with s.46 regulations` (JUST (YMD 2026 1 1)))
-- K63-18 .. K63-20: hypothetical regulation dates, each side of "whichever is later".
#ASSERT `the commencement day under section 63(a)(1)` (`ind-b facts with regulations in force on` (YMD 2025 3 1)) EQUALS YMD 2025 6 1
#ASSERT `the day the Law commences for a system with any other refrigerant under section 63(a)(2)` (`ind-b facts with regulations in force on` (YMD 2025 3 1)) EQUALS YMD 2026 12 1
#ASSERT `the commencement day under section 63(a)(1)` (`ind-b facts with regulations in force on` (YMD 2025 4 14)) EQUALS YMD 2025 7 14
#ASSERT `the day the Law commences for a system with any other refrigerant under section 63(a)(2)` (`ind-b facts with regulations in force on` (YMD 2025 4 14)) EQUALS YMD 2027 1 14
#ASSERT `the commencement day under section 63(a)(1)` (`ind-b facts with regulations in force on` (YMD 2025 11 30)) EQUALS YMD 2026 2 28
#ASSERT `the day the Law commences for a system with any other refrigerant under section 63(a)(2)` (`ind-b facts with regulations in force on` (YMD 2025 11 30)) EQUALS YMD 2027 8 28

§§ `A2. s.63(b): Chapter 6 when no s.46 regulations have been made (K63-11, fork F-C-8)`

-- "Whichever is later" cannot be satisfied until s.46 regulations come into force, so on any day before that
-- Chapter 6 has not commenced: FALSE.  The encoder refuses, and offers FALSE as the callable alternative.
#ASSERT NOT `Chapter 6 was in force on the day of the act` (YMD 2030 1 1) `given the facts` (`ind-b actual facts with s.46 regulations` NOTHING)

§§ `A3. s.27: a supported-body employee who is not employed by the body he represents (C27-4, gap G-27)`

-- src:216 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} חבר המועצה שאינו עובד המדינה, עובד גוף מתוקצב או עובד גוף נתמך, לא יהיה זכאי לתשלום מאת המשרד בעד השתתפות בישיבות המועצה, אך יהיה זכאי לקבל החזר הוצאות נסיעה סבירות שהוציא לצורך השתתפותו בישיבות המועצה, בהתאם להוראות של החשב הכללי במשרד האוצר החלות לעניין חברי ועדות ציבוריות; בסעיף זה, ”עובד המדינה“, ”עובד גוף מתוקצב“ ו”עובד גוף נתמך“ – כהגדרתם {{ח:חיצוני|חוק יסודות התקציב#סעיף 32|בסעיף 32 לחוק יסודות התקציב, התשמ״ה–1985}}.
-- src:217 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} חבר המועצה שהוא עובד המדינה, עובד גוף מתוקצב או עובד באותו גוף שהוא מייצג במועצה, לא יהיה זכאי להחזר הוצאות כאמור בסעיף קטן (א).
-- (a) grants the travel refund only to a member who is NOT a State, budgeted-body or supported-body employee;
-- (b) does not name supported bodies.  (a) is the only grant, so: not entitled (FALSE).  The encoder refuses,
-- reading the section as silent on him.
#ASSERT NOT `s 27 — the member is entitled to a refund of reasonable travel expenses` (`Employment of a member of the Council` WITH `a State employee` IS FALSE, `an employee of a budgeted body` IS FALSE, `an employee of a supported body` IS TRUE, `an employee of the body the member represents on the Council` IS FALSE)

§§ `A4. s.36(d): changing a condition on WORK PROCEDURES after a written hearing (I36-8, fork F-CHANGE)`

-- src:303 | {{ח:תת|(ד)}} השר רשאי להורות בכתב ההסמכה על תנאים והוראות לעניין דרכי פעולתו וסדרי עבודתו של בודק או של מומחה, ובכלל זה לפי סוגים של בדיקות עזר שהוא מוסמך לבצע, ורשאי הוא לשנות תנאים והוראות שנתן לעניין דרכי פעולתו לאחר שניתנה לבודק או למומחה הזדמנות לטעון את טענותיו בכתב.
-- The power to set reaches modes of action and work procedures; the power to change names only modes of action.
-- My expectation (I36-8) read the change power over the conditions the Minister gave, after a hearing: TRUE.  The
-- encoder reads the change power literally, as narrower; its reading B (my answer) passes in ind-b-tests-g5.l4.
#ASSERT `s 36(d) — the change may be made: it concerns modes of action, and the tester or expert was given an opportunity to argue in writing` (`Change under section 36(d)` WITH `kind` IS `a condition or instruction as to work procedures`, `the tester or expert was given an opportunity to argue in writing` IS TRUE)
